21
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,080
Insolent brat,

22
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:12,760
you will regret your recklessness !

23
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:15,680
Arrogant Junior,

24
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,880
how dare you harm an Elder of the Sun Family

25
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:20,680
and destroy our defensive formation !?

26
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:20,850
Sun Leng
Sun Family Elder
Peak Late stage
Soul Transformation

27
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:20,850
Sun Huan
Sun Family Elder
Peak Late stage
Soul Transformation

28
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:20,850
Sun Xu
Sun Family Elder
Peak Late stage
Soul Transformation

29
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:23,600
If you break your own arms and kneel in apology,

30
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:25,640
I will spare your life for now !

31
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:31,720
I met this Elder Sun through a transaction.

32
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:34,840
He obtained a flying sword and a bronze mirror

33
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:36,520
through a trade with me.

34
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:38,840
If you open his bag of holding,

35
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:41,040
you can verify what I said.

36
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:43,440
He coveted one of my artifacts

37
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,480
and tried to kill me for it.

38
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,120
After I drove him back,

39
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:49,200
he fled all the way here.

40
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:52,200
He's likely telling the truth...

41
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:55,720
But the Sun Family cannot tolerate a Junior running rampant !

42
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:57,840
No matter which family he is from,

43
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:00,040
we will capture him with the Demon Sealing Formation

44
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:01,600
and wait for his Elders

45
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:03,000
to decide whether he lives or dies !

46
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,800
Since you're doing this,

47
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:33,480
it seems the entire Sun Family is an accomplice.

48
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:43,720
What cultivation level does this child have !?

49
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:46,040
This pressure far exceeds Soul Transformation !

50
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:47,280
Could he be...

51
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,040
Fellow cultivator,

52
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,760
please calm your anger.

53
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,170
Sun Qiming
Sun Family Grand Elder
Peak Late stage Soul Transformation

54
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,320
Grand Elder !

55
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:56,040
Ascendant Divine Sense ?

56
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:59,000
The Sun Family has offended you, fellow cultivator.

57
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,800
We are willing to compensate for it.

58
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:03,170
Please tell us what you want, fellow cultivator.

59
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,280
Don't trouble my Juniors.

60
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,400
200 000 celestial jades

61
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:10,000
and this matter is settled.

62
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,050
Agreed.

63
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:16,800
But the amount you requested is too much.

64
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:18,840
We are only a branch of the Sun Family.

65
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:20,840
Fellow cultivator, please wait 3 days

66
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:23,640
to allow us to gather the celestial jades.

67
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,640
He agreed rather quickly...

68
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:29,720
If the Sun Family Ancestor is not magnanimous,

69
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:32,040
then he must have ulterior motives.

70
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,520
Agreed.

71
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:37,040
Giving 200 000 celestial jades at once

72
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,200
is a terrible loss

73
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:39,840
even for the main family !

74
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:42,600
The Ancestor personally ordered

75
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,800
to grant all his requests.

76
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,290
This is an order,

77
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,880
don't allow what happened today to leak.

78
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,920
And never disturb this person.

79
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:53,240
Anyone who causes trouble

80
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:54,800
will be immediately banished

81
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,160
until a decision is made.

82
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:01,600
Now that I have tens of thousands of celestial jades on me,

83
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:03,720
I need to absorb them all as soon as possible

84
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:06,320
to reach Middle stage Ascendant.

85
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,400
You...

86
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:09,360
Stop here.

87
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:11,760
Junior of the Sun Family...

88
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:14,240
If you dare to stir up trouble,

89
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:16,280
I will be merciless.

90
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,680
Do you know

91
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:20,680
what is most important for cultivation ?

92
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:22,400
Please enlighten me.

93
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,200
Let me tell you.

94
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,720
The most important is diligence !

95
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,760
Although you lack talent,

96
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:29,560
if you are diligent in your cultivation

97
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:31,160
you may still make progress one day.

98
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,440
I guard this Spirit Vein

99
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:36,440
and have seen many Core Formation, Nascent Soul and even Soul Formation cultivators.

100
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,440
But I have never seen anyone like you

101
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:41,520
that stops meditating to wander around the city in the morning.

102
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:44,760
The fiend usually kills without blinking an eye

103
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:47,240
but he's letting a Junior lecture him ?

104
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:49,960
This scene is probably a once-in-a-millennium event !

105
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:51,840
I must make sure to remember it !

106
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,720
Senior is right.

107
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,570
It’s not that I look down on you

108
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:57,200
but in this cultivation world

109
00:05:57,280 --> 00:06:00,000
only the self-reliant can go far.

110
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:03,080
If you have any questions about cultivation in the future,

111
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:04,440
you may ask me about them.

112
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:06,610
Remember to be diligent in your cultivation.

113
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:08,490
Don't let you mind and body be lazy.

114
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:10,050
You may go in now.

115
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,600
Although this person’s cultivation is weak,

116
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,680
compared to the deceit and treachery of the Alliance Star System,

117
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,800
this isn't unpleasant.

118
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:36,570
3 days later

119
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,840
After reaching Ascendant,

120
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,320
cultivating with celestial jades

121
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:43,360
consumes too much...

122
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:46,800
Even with the Sun Family’s 200 000 celestial jades,

123
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:49,800
I won't reach Middle stage Ascendant.

124
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:54,040
To make a push for the second step,

125
00:06:54,200 --> 00:06:56,280
the amount of celestial jades needed is unimaginable.

126
00:06:57,200 --> 00:06:59,000
The Celestial Realm is no more.

127
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:02,640
Maybe what the second step requires is not celestial jades,

128
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:05,200
but something else.

129
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,200
Senior,

130
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:08,920
Sun Qiming of the Sun Family requests an audience.

131
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:14,040
The 200 000 celestial jades have been sent from the main family.

132
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,880
Please Senior, check them.

133
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,290
No need.

134
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:18,520
You may leave.

135
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,600
Our last meeting was too short.

136
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,720
Junior still does not know your honorable name.

137
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:26,360
Xu Mu

138
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:27,640
Senior,

139
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:29,840
In 7 days, an auction will be held

140
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:31,520
at the Whole Treasure Pavilion.

141
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,770
Among the items,

142
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:35,080
there will be a grade 8 pseudo-divine pill.

143
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,200
Senior,

144
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,880
this is the invitation to the auction.

145
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:52,200
Reveal the information about the grade 8 pill to this person

146
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,880
to test him.

147
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:57,040
This pill is extremely effective for Ascendant cultivators.

148
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,720
If he is interested,

149
00:07:58,760 --> 00:08:00,880
then he is just Ascendant

150
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:03,200
and he will surely take it.

151
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:05,600
And if he is not interested ?

152
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:08,320
Then his cultivation is above Ascendant

153
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,520
and you

154
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:12,210
must withdraw the Sun Family’s forces from the city

155
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:14,200
to avoid any further involvement.

156
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,240
Give it to me.

157
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,000
This kind of test

158
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:32,320
will not happen a second time.

159
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,080
Understood.

160
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,920
You've come...

161
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,000
Sit down.

162
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:54,200
The Sun Family invited me to the auction.

163
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:57,000
This kind of test feels strange.

164
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,040
Is there something wrong ?

165
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,800
I can feel that

166
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:02,680
they are afraid of something.

167
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:04,560
Afraid ?

168
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:09,480
They are indeed living in fear and dread.

169
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:10,880
They

170
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:14,200
have brought a huge disaster upon themselves.

171
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:16,480
4 years ago,

172
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:19,520
in the space near Planet Ran Yun,

173
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:22,360
the Sun Family Ancestor, Sun Xi,

174
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:25,680
Carefree Xanren, Zhao Chuanwen,

175
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:28,880
and the Ran Family Ancestor, Ran Xuefeng,

176
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,720
joined forces

177
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:35,360
to ambush and kill a severely wounded cultivator who had fled here.

178
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:41,200
They obtained 5 pills.

179
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:45,400
5 grade 8 pseudo-divine pills.

180
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:48,120
But after the excitement,

181
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,880
inside that person's bag of holding

182
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,760
they found

183
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,960
a token from...

184
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:57,000
Planet Thousand Illusions.

185
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:59,280
A token of the Huan Family.

186
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,410
The Huan Family ?

187
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:01,040
Yes !

188
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:06,080
The very Huan Family of Planet Thousand Illusions, the leader of the Northern Domain.

189
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,200
Ceng Niu,

190
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,640
do you know how the Huan Family acts

191
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:12,600
and how overbearing they are ?

192
00:10:12,640 --> 00:10:14,200
If a family member is killed,

193
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,960
all parties involved

194
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,480
no matter their identity,

195
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:19,850
will have their entire family exterminated.

196
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:23,240
Even if the items from the dead person’s bag end up in someone else’s hands,

197
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:24,480
merely possessing them

198
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:26,440
is likely to be seen as provocation

199
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:28,280
and trigger their wrath.

200
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,160
That token

201
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:32,320
and those pills

202
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,920
are all death sentences.

203
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:37,560
Once you’re stained by them, you can’t shake them off.

204
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:39,040
These past 4 years,

205
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:41,280
they have been walking on thin ice

206
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:43,640
and living in fear that one day

207
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:46,600
the Huan Family’s thunderous wrath

208
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,760
will come for them.

209
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:51,120
So this auction

210
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,560
is a bait

211
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:54,120
to hook me

212
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:56,040
in this karma with the Huan Family.

213
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:58,920
They're trying to put me in the same boat as them.

214
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:04,200
They want to atone for their crime

215
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:06,080
to avoid the extermination of their families

216
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,880
by framing you.

217
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:10,120
If the Huan Family investigates,

218
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:12,320
they will put all the blame on you.

219
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,690
Or at least,

220
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:15,520
they'll use you as an excuse.

221
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,800
What a clever scheme,

222
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:20,880
shifting the blame on others to have them do the dirty work.

223
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,920
Ran Xuefeng...

224
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,800
Sun Xi...

225
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:26,920
Zhao Chuanwen...

226
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:29,320
This matter will have too many consequences,

227
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,800
don't get involved.

228
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:32,200
Thank you.

229
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:34,840
A grade 8 pseudo-divine pill

230
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:38,000
would at least allow me to directly reach Middle stage Ascendant.

231
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:40,600
To reach Planet Dong Lin as soon as possible,

232
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:42,400
I must obtain this pill.

233
00:11:43,160 --> 00:11:44,880
This trap might be sinister

234
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,840
but I must walk into it.

235
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:54,610
Huan Family Ancestral Home
Planet Thousand Illusions

236
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:56,810
That family member went missing 4 years ago.

237
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:59,930
Huan Wuqing
Huan Family Ancestor

238
00:11:57,040 --> 00:12:00,120
Why are we only dealing with it now ?

239
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:01,600
Ancestor,

240
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:03,600
that person was merely a branch family member.

241
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:05,440
The Huan Family has many members

242
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,890
so they're hard to track.

243
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:08,650
Huan Fengshen
Huan Family Head

244
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:08,880
We have only learned of this matter recently.

245
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:10,400
Ancestor, how do you think

246
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:12,440
we should handle this matter ?

247
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:14,680
Now that we know,

248
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:17,080
we can't ignore it anymore.

249
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:19,200
All those involved

250
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,960
must be eradicated !

251
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:24,240
Leave this matter to Huan Mei.

252
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:26,600
Let her assign her own people to handle it.

253
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,530
It's a perfect opportunity

254
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:30,440
to have her establish authority.

255
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:33,160
As the Ancestor orders.

256
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,720
I shall take my leave.

257
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:40,400
Ever since the Ancestor went to the Alliance and brought back Huan Mei,

258
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:41,730
3 months ago

259
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:43,680
he stopped dealing with affairs of the family.

260
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:45,200
From now on,

261
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:48,800
Huan Mei will be this old man’s core disciple.

262
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:51,640
Now, the Ancestor went out of his way

263
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:55,240
to sacrifice his cultivation and use the blood exchange ritual on an outsider.

264
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:59,360
Now he's helping her establish her authority in the family...

265
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:02,760
Does he really intend to give the Huan Family

266
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:05,680
to this woman ?

267
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:10,210
Attic
Huan Family Ancestral Home

268
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:19,000
Planet Ran Yun ?

269
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:21,040
Huan Dong,

270
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:24,130
Huan Dong
Huan Family
Peak Middle stage Ascendant

271
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:23,320
I'm here.

272
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:26,520
Your cultivation has reached Peak Middle stage Ascendant.

273
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:29,080
This trip should be easy.

274
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:31,410
Although this is a minor matter,

275
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:33,680
it's my first task for the Huan Family.

